{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "3631f6a2-3ea8-417d-80ec-c45b55d9b429",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2023",
            "content": {
                "en": "(It’s that family of three I saw earlier...)",
                "zh": "（是之前见过的一家三口...）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -498.66668701171877,
            "positionY": 360.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bcc7dab2-cd71-447a-b620-6da54d672ec7",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2024",
            "content": {
                "en": "(They seem to be locals returning from a trip. They probably know a bit about what’s going on in Yuntai. I could use this chance to ask about the city.)",
                "zh": "（他们似乎是旅游回来的本地居民，对芸台市的近况较为了解。 我可以趁机打听一些当地的事。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4105.3330078125,
            "positionY": 358.0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_2025",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "About this \"Troupe Elysium\"...",
                        "zh": "关于这个“极乐戏团”...",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [
                        {
                            "targetObjectID": "",
                            "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "variableName": "infoPassA_1",
                            "comparison": 0,
                            "compareValue": "False"
                        }
                    ],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                },
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_2026",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "What is the festival?",
                        "zh": "您提到的大会是指？",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [
                        {
                            "targetObjectID": "",
                            "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "variableName": "infoPassA_2",
                            "comparison": 0,
                            "compareValue": "False"
                        }
                    ],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                },
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_2027",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Thank you for telling me all this.",
                        "zh": "非常感谢您告诉我这些事。（结束对话）",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [
                        {
                            "targetObjectID": "",
                            "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "variableName": "infoPassA_1",
                            "comparison": 0,
                            "compareValue": "True"
                        },
                        {
                            "targetObjectID": "",
                            "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "variableName": "infoPassA_2",
                            "comparison": 0,
                            "compareValue": "True"
                        }
                    ],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                }
            ],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8c52c5bd-4fa7-4d19-b6c2-154985fbc15d",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "0d2edd26-5554-47f2-b61f-99a5a0caf64b",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2028",
            "content": {
                "en": "Dad! Look! This arm can bend all the way back! So cool!",
                "zh": "爸爸！你看这个可以从后面弯过去，好厉害啊！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -160.0,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2f978e8e-7505-4b79-b2e1-405342ea22ca",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2030",
            "content": {
                "en": "(No point overthinking it. Let’s try talking to them.)",
                "zh": "（胡思乱想也没有用，试着搭一下话吧。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 602.6666870117188,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0e6cd887-5e6b-4094-a8eb-3df7424ccb9d",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2031",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’ve never seen a puppet like that before. May I ask where you got it?",
                "zh": "我从来没有见过这种样式的木偶呢？请问你们是在哪里买到的呢？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 950.6666870117188,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0511f7d5-4333-4cf8-8256-d26983c47fe3",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2034",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sigh… I really didn’t want him to take that puppet. Those people in cloaks were just too weird.",
                "zh": "唉，我其实不希望他收下那个木偶的，那些穿着斗篷的人实在太奇怪了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2014.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 364.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b7c454c2-47b6-4b6a-8c62-226554c05cc6",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2036",
            "content": {
                "en": "I didn’t want to take it, but he kept begging, and now he won’t go anywhere without it.",
                "zh": "我实在拗不过这孩子才同意让他收下的，没想到他喜欢到出来旅行都要带着。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3774.0,
            "positionY": 358.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2eaa9554-ed28-4983-85ee-e36b153ad33e",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2038",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sorry to bother you, but may I ask what festival you were talking about earlier?",
                "zh": "不好意思，请问您之前提到的大会是指什么呢？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4541.3330078125,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "targetSceneName": "",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "methodName": "SetInfoPass2True",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "03a08ebb-ba38-46ff-855a-3d7cd0a64754",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2039",
            "content": {
                "en": "Don’t worry about it, sweetie—you’re not from Yuntai, are you?",
                "zh": "别客气，小姑娘你不是芸台本地人吧？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4541.3330078125,
            "positionY": 1112.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "targetSceneName": "",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "methodName": "SetInfoPass3True",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0df8024f-669c-4680-ba93-aa00b27a9f01",
            "index": 17,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2040",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh dear, kids your age really do love mysterious groups like that, huh~",
                "zh": "哎呀，你们这个年纪的孩子果然会对这种神秘团体感兴趣呢~",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4906.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "44cc4260-e22a-452c-b56b-aba37f3b6505",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2041",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hehe~ I used to be into that kind of thing back in college too. I even joined a local folklore club—ended up meeting this boy’s father thanks to that. Kinda romantic, right?",
                "zh": "呵呵呵~阿姨我大学的时候也很喜欢研究这种事，还加入了研究本地民俗的社团，拜此所赐遇见了这孩子的父亲，很青春吧？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5302.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f97cba86-77b1-4bd3-a5d5-8cc7fbd14b68",
            "index": 19,
            "characterId": "318c68cb-5927-41a5-91bd-bf8aa614ee91",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2042",
            "content": {
                "en": "...... (blushing)",
                "zh": "......（脸红）。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5680.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e9820597-868d-4bad-b788-9c961a85adba",
            "index": 20,
            "characterId": "0d2edd26-5554-47f2-b61f-99a5a0caf64b",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2043",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hahaha! Dad's embarrassed again!",
                "zh": "哈哈哈哈爸爸又不好意思了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6042.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b724b8a5-9dd1-4cc1-bef3-549fd2949676",
            "index": 21,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2044",
            "content": {
                "en": "(What a lively family.)",
                "zh": "（真是个有活力的家庭啊。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6444.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5f76f23e-bf86-4296-bb56-543c1dcde82d",
            "index": 22,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2045",
            "content": {
                "en": "But honestly, I don’t know that much about the troupe itself.",
                "zh": "不过我确实不是很了解这个戏团的事。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6788.66650390625,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ea70856c-866b-4cf5-8a56-f568728b5e65",
            "index": 23,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2047",
            "content": {
                "en": "They looked super suspicious. If their flyers hadn’t said they were performing at this year’s Qiqiao Festival, I’d honestly have thought they were some weird cult sneaking into the city.",
                "zh": "那些人看起来实在太可疑了，要不是他们的宣传单写着要在今年乞巧大会上表演，我都担心是有什么奇怪的异教团体混进了芸台。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7440.0,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "32eeb0a5-1562-4a06-9f87-73c14a16c9da",
            "index": 24,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2049",
            "content": {
                "en": "You don’t know? It’s the Qiqiao Festival—held in Yuntai every two years! It’s one of our city’s biggest celebrations.",
                "zh": "你不知道吗？芸台每两年一届的乞巧大会啊！那可是芸台特有的，城市级别的盛会。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4890.66650390625,
            "positionY": 744.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fda8e819-fa1f-4e87-968a-bdfeaef6f61b",
            "index": 26,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2051",
            "content": {
                "en": "Right, I think this flight’s supposed to land around 8 p.m. Still about an hour to go.",
                "zh": "嗯，我们这班飞机好像预计是晚上八点落地吧，还有一个多小时。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5956.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "87470ae2-27fc-4efd-bb8e-c1c12a88d50f",
            "index": 27,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2052",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Qiqiao… I think I’ve heard of it. Isn’t it an astrology-related festival? We don’t celebrate it where I’m from.)",
                "zh": "（乞巧？我记得好像是和星象相关的节日？我们那里没有过这个节的习惯。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6318.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f5430c64-1bf8-489c-92f5-58669836ae91",
            "index": 28,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2053",
            "content": {
                "en": "I think I’ve heard of Qiqiao before. Is there a tradition of star worship here in Yuntai?",
                "zh": "乞巧节我似乎有印象，芸台是有拜双星的传统吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6720.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "702a9086-23cb-4748-9ec9-a8bd92b04ec2",
            "index": 29,
            "characterId": "3d45c290-c43f-4868-8131-241d597b548c",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2054",
            "content": {
                "en": "Star worship?",
                "zh": "双星？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7097.3330078125,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "02a131c3-27c7-4640-a6b7-967b2bf90aeb",
            "index": 30,
            "characterId": "327ce24b-ea8e-4a5a-8219-89a8de213288",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2055",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh, that part’s not really practiced anymore~ But there are still a lot of people who worship Xi Mu.",
                "zh": "啊，芸台现在的乞巧大会已经没有拜星环节啦~不过拜喜母的人似乎还是有很多的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7440.0,
            "positionY": 740.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "60fdcb60-2edb-462f-b15c-3f1380831fe7",
            "index": 31,
            "characterId": "318c68cb-5927-41a5-91bd-bf8aa614ee91",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2057",
            "content": {
                "en": "Most of the outside groups that compete in the festival don’t cause any trouble, historically speaking.",
                "zh": "不过历年来参与斗巧的外地团体其实很少，一般不会起什么事端。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8162.0,
            "positionY": 738.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8c50eeb8-f34e-4405-9fd3-f2707016a461",
            "index": 32,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2058",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Xi Mu? Craft duels? I want to ask more, but I’ve already kept them long enough. Better leave it here for now.)",
                "zh": "（喜母？斗巧？虽然很想再了解一些内容，但已经打扰他们太久了，就先到这里吧。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8526.6669921875,
            "positionY": 738.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "1175873a-279b-436d-9780-9ead830025e7",
